    "body": "Hi.\r\nThis bug still seems to be happening for me on a Debian host using the `bash` shell.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38272327/134641691-0776d8c2-b915-410d-bd61-de4357825027.png)\r\n\r\nVersion of Starship that is installed.\r\n```\r\n$ starship --version\r\nstarship 0.58.0\r\ntag:v0.58.0\r\ncommit_hash:0a60d1e9\r\nbuild_time:2021-09-21 13:43:49 +00:00\r\nbuild_env:rustc 1.55.0 (c8dfcfe04 2021-09-06),\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe `~/.config/starship.toml` file:\r\n```\r\n# See: https://starship.rs/config/\r\n# Enable with: eval \"$(starship init bash)\"\r\n\r\n# Don't print a new line at the start of the prompt\r\nadd_newline = false\r\n\r\n# Format of the prompt\r\nformat = \"\"\"\r\n[╭─](bold green)$username$hostname$directory$git_branch$git_state$git_status$aws$time$cmd_duration$shlvl$jobs$status\r\n[╰─](bold green)$character\r\n\"\"\"\r\n\r\n[aws]\r\nformat = '[$symbol($profile)(\\[$duration\\]) ](bright-cyan)'\r\nsymbol = '☁️ '\r\n\r\n# The character at the end of the prompt.\r\n[character]\r\nerror_symbol = \"[\\\\$](bold red)\"\r\nsuccess_symbol = \"[\\\\$](bold green)\"\r\nvicmd_symbol = \"[✎](bold blue)\"\r\n\r\n[cmd_duration]\r\nformat = '⏱ [$duration ]($style)'\r\n\r\n[directory]\r\nformat = '[ $path$read_only](bright-blue) '\r\ntruncation_length = 0\r\ntruncate_to_repo = false\r\n\r\n[git_branch]\r\nformat = '[$symbol$branch]($style) '\r\nsymbol = ''\r\n\r\n[git_state]\r\ncherry_pick = \"[🍒 PICKING]($style)\"\r\n\r\n[git_status]\r\nahead = '⇡${count}'\r\nbehind = '⇣${count}'\r\nconflicted = '=${count}'\r\ndeleted = '✘${count}'\r\ndiverged = '⇕⇡${ahead_count}⇣${behind_count}'\r\nmodified = '!${count}'\r\nrenamed = '»${count}'\r\nstaged = '+${count}'\r\nstashed = '\\$${count}'\r\nuntracked = '?${count}'\r\n\r\n[hostname]\r\nformat = \"[@$hostname](bright-blue)\"\r\n\r\n[jobs]\r\nnumber_threshold = 1\r\n\r\n[shlvl]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nthreshold = 1\r\n\r\n[status]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nformat = '[\\[$symbol EXIT_CODE\\($status\\) $common_meaning(SIG$signal_name\\($signal_number\\))\\]]($style) '\r\nmap_symbol = true\r\npipestatus = true\r\n\r\n[time]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nformat = \"[🕙$time ]($style)\"\r\ntime_format = \"%T\"\r\n\r\n[username]\r\nformat = \"[$user]($style)\"\r\nstyle_user = \"bright-blue\"\r\nshow_always = true\r\n```\r\n\r\nVersion of Debian:\r\n```\r\n$ cat /etc/os-release \r\nPRETTY_NAME=\"Debian GNU/Linux 11 (bullseye)\"\r\nNAME=\"Debian GNU/Linux\"\r\nVERSION_ID=\"11\"\r\nVERSION=\"11 (bullseye)\"\r\nVERSION_CODENAME=bullseye\r\nID=debian\r\nHOME_URL=\"https://www.debian.org/\"\r\nSUPPORT_URL=\"https://www.debian.org/support\"\r\nBUG_REPORT_URL=\"https://bugs.debian.org/\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nVersion of `bash`:\r\n```\r\n$ bash --version\r\nGNU bash, version 5.1.4(1)-release (x86_64-pc-linux-gnu)\r\nCopyright (C) 2020 Free Software Foundation, Inc.\r\nLicense GPLv3+: GNU GPL version 3 or later <http://gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html>\r\n\r\nThis is free software; you are free to change and redistribute it.\r\nThere is NO WARRANTY, to the extent permitted by law.\r\n```",
